  "situation": "Freespace Solutions hold a freighter. The recovery captain is in the bridge (C1) with a guard. Taken alive, they will talk.",
  "briefing": [
    {
      "heading": "Tasking",
      "text": "Capture a high-value target. Take a named enemy alive and bring them out."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Situation",
      "text": "Freespace Solutions hold a freighter. The recovery captain is in the bridge (C1) with a guard. Taken alive, they will talk."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Objective",
      "text": "The bridge (C1). The high-value target (HVT) is the tier's HVT model, placed at the objective with the guard. Take it by overpowering it in close combat, capturing it while Down (chapter 7), or when it surrenders: the HVT tests to surrender (chapter 10) whenever it is Pinned or Wounded with a player model within 6\" and no friend within 6\". A prisoner moves with a player model in base contact, which halves that model's Move."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Opposition",
      "text": "Freespace Solutions, threat tier 1. Guard (known): Asset security (3 models) with the Recovery Captain, at the objective, Unaware. Contacts (unknown): 3 chips."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Ground",
      "text": "Freighter / ore hauler, deck 42. Hazard: Power failure: the whole deck is in darkness (chapter 8)."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Complication",
      "text": "Hazard: see Ground."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Extraction and time",
      "text": "Out by the airlock (P1). Enemy entry and exit: P4. Small mission: 20 minutes, clock die d4. Check-ins every 5 minutes from minute 10. Alert track starts at 0."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Grades",
      "text": "Decisive: HVT extracted as a prisoner and no player model Dead. Marginal: HVT extracted as a prisoner, or Dead (with the body or its data recovered: an Interact in base contact). Failure: HVT escaped or still at large when time runs out."
    }
  ],
